   Oláh, J (Corresponding Author), Univ Debrecen, Fac Econ \& Business, H-4032 Debrecen, Hungary.
   Oláh, J (Corresponding Author), Czech Univ Life Sci Prague, Fac Econ \& Management, Dept Trade \& Finance, Prague, Czech Republic.
   Kasza, Gyula; Izso, Tekla; Kunszabo, Atilla; Szakos, David; Suth, Miklos, Univ Vet Med Budapest, Inst Food Chain Sci, Istvan Utca 2, H-1078 Budapest, Hungary.
